# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# Short links for the booking flow.
#
# Cloudflare Pages already serves every page without its ".html" and sends
# "/page.html" to "/page". So NEVER add a rule from "/page" to "/page.html":
# the two redirects chase each other and the page never opens (this broke
# /brushes and /checkout). "/checkout" and "/brushes" work without a rule.
/book            /booking      301
/thanks          /thank-you    301
